===Noun===
{{en-noun|specificities}}
{{wikipedia|sensitivity and specificity}}

# The state of being [[specific]] rather than [[general]].
# {{lb|en|general}} The extent to which a characteristic is specific to a given person, place, or thing; thus: 
## {{lb|en|statistics}} The [[probability]], in a [[binary]] [[test]], of a true [[negative]] being correctly identified.
## {{lb|en|medicine}} The extent to which a particular diagnostic test is specific for a given condition.

